# machine translated (Swahili), not yet reviewed by a person.

# Title of the Help topic "AI programs".
settings-help-topics-ai-programs-title = Programu za AI

# Words people might search for the Help topic "AI programs" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-ai-programs-keywords = ai claude codex cursor gemini aider coding agent fence private files share folder ssh keys sudo assistant mcp flathub restart cache uzio faragha faili shiriki folda funguo msaidizi anzisha upya akiba

# Help topic "AI programs": paragraph 1.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-ai-programs-p1 = Hii inazuia programu za AI zisifikie faili zako binafsi. Kwa mfano, inazuia programu iliyodanganywa ikusanye taarifa za benki yako na kuzituma nje. Ni kinga yenye mipaka, si dhamana. Programu iliyodhamiria, hitilafu katika programu za kompyuta, au wewe kuidhinisha ombi au kushiriki folda bado vinaweza kuruhusu kitu kipite.

# Help topic "AI programs": paragraph 2.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-ai-programs-p2 = Programu inayoendeshwa ndani ya uzio huona folda tupu ya nyumbani. Haiwezi kusoma hati zako, funguo za ssh, manenosiri yaliyohifadhiwa wala taarifa zako za kuingia kwenye kivinjari. Huona tu folda unazoshiriki, mahali pale pale kama zako. Bado inaweza kuona mfumo wote mwingine, kwa hiyo inaweza kusoma kumbukumbu na kuendesha amri. Kila inachoanzisha, pamoja na programu inazoweka, kinabaki ndani ya uzio.

# Help topic "AI programs": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 3.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-ai-programs-step3-1 = Ili kushiriki folda, ibofye kulia kwenye Folders kisha uchague Shiriki na programu za AI, au tumia Shiriki folda kwenye ukurasa wa Programu za AI.

# Help topic "AI programs": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 3.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-ai-programs-step3-2 = Huwezi kamwe kushiriki folda zilizofichwa, wala folda zinazohifadhi funguo, manenosiri au barua pepe.

# Help topic "AI programs": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 3.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-ai-programs-step3-3 = Ili kufikia kompyuta nyingine kwa ssh, iongeze kwenye ukurasa. Trindle hutumia ufunguo tofauti, unaofanya kazi kwa kompyuta ulizoorodhesha tu.

# Help topic "AI programs": step 4 of the numbered steps at block 3.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-ai-programs-step3-4 = Amri ikihitaji haki za msimamizi, Trindle hufungua dirisha nje ya uzio na kukusubiri.

# Help topic "AI programs": paragraph 4.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-ai-programs-p4 = Programu zilizoorodheshwa kwenye ukurasa tu ndizo huanza ndani ya uzio. Programu unayoanzisha kwa njia nyingine haiko ndani ya uzio. Ukizima uzio kwenye ukurasa, programu za AI zinaweza kuona kila kitu unachoweza kuona. Ukisakinisha muunganisho wa msaidizi (trindle-mcp), msaidizi aliyeunganishwa anaweza kusoma vitu fulani bila kukuuliza. Anaweza kusoma madirisha yako wazi, programu zilizosakinishwa, programu zinazoendeshwa, mipangilio ya Trindle, kumbukumbu za mfumo, madokezo ya hivi karibuni ya hitilafu na vifaa. Anaweza pia kusoma hali ya kumbukumbu, diski, betri na mtandao. Kwa programu uliyosakinisha kutoka Flathub, anaweza kusoma majina ya mipangilio yake, lakini kamwe si thamani zake. Huuliza kabla ya kubadilisha chochote. Programu ya Flathub ikiharibika, anaweza kuianzisha upya, kubadilisha mpangilio wake mmoja au kufuta akiba yake, kila kimoja baada ya kukuuliza. Unaweza kumwomba atendue mpangilio uliobadilishwa au akiba iliyofutwa, lakini kuanzisha upya hakutenduliki.

# Title of the Help topic "Welcome to Trindle".
settings-help-topics-welcome-title = Karibu kwenye Trindle

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Welcome to Trindle" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-welcome-keywords = start begin new first introduction what is how edge open windows anza mwanzo mpya utangulizi karibu pembeni fungua madirisha

# Help topic "Welcome to Trindle": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-welcome-p1 = Trindle inaiweka skrini yako wazi. Hakuna upau wala menyu pembezoni, ni madirisha yako tu na mandhari yako. Kila kitu kingine kiko kwenye duara moja linaloitwa pete. Inaonekana unapoiomba na kutoweka ukimaliza.

# Help topic "Welcome to Trindle": caption and spoken name of picture 2 (ring-first.png).
settings-help-topics-welcome-pic2 = Pete, ikiwa na saa na tarehe katikati

# Help topic "Welcome to Trindle": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-welcome-p3 = Unaweza kufanya kila kitu kwa kipanya au kidole. Hivi ndivyo unavyofungua pete, ambapo madirisha yako yalipo:

# Help topic "Welcome to Trindle": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-welcome-step4-1 = Peleka kielekezi pembeni ya skrini kisha ubofye mara mbili. Pete inafunguka.

# Help topic "Welcome to Trindle": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-welcome-step4-2 = Kitufe cha Super pia kinaifungua.

# Help topic "Welcome to Trindle": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-welcome-step4-3 = Madirisha yako yaliyofunguliwa yako kwenye pete. Bofya moja ili kuliweka mbele.

# Help topic "Welcome to Trindle": paragraph 5.
settings-help-topics-welcome-p5 = Karibu ni ziara fupi inayofunguka unapoingia mara ya kwanza. Inatumia picha zinazosogea kukuonyesha yote haya. Inauliza unajua kiasi gani tayari na kuruka unachoweza kufanya tayari. Unaweza kufungua Karibu tena wakati wowote kutoka Programu zote.

# Help topic "Welcome to Trindle": paragraph 6.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-welcome-p6 = Kitufe kinachoweza kukupotezea kitu, kama pipa, kinahitaji kubofya mara mbili. Kubofya mara ya kwanza kunakijaza kwa rangi ya kuangazia na kuonyesha alama ya tiki. Bofya tena ili kuendelea. Ukikiacha, kitufe kinarudi kawaida baada ya sekunde tatu.

# Title of the Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps".
settings-help-topics-ring-title = Kufungua pete na kupata programu

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-ring-keywords = launcher tray icons brightness tools apps applications start menu open program edge click favourites favorites all apps categories office games type search find filter programu zote pendwa tafuta andika michezo ofisi mwangaza

# Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-ring-p1 = Peleka kielekezi kwenye ukingo kabisa wa skrini, ukingo wowote, kisha ubofye mara mbili. Pete inaonekana. Inafanya kazi dirisha likijaza skrini, lakini si juu ya mchezo au video ya skrini nzima, ambapo kila kubofya kunakwenda kwa dirisha hilo. Kusogeza tu kielekezi ukingoni hakuifungui kamwe, kwa hiyo haiwezi kutokea kwa bahati mbaya. Kubofya mara moja mahali pengine kwenye eneo-kazi hakufungui chochote. Kitufe cha Super pia kinafungua pete, hata juu ya dirisha la skrini nzima. Kubofya mara mbili kwenye eneo-kazi tupu pia kunaifungua.

# Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-ring-p2 = Katikati kuna saa na tarehe na safu ya aikoni ndogo. Hizi ni sauti, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi na betri, na kikombe kinachoweka skrini macho. Kibodi ya skrini inaonekana hapa ukishaiwasha kwenye Mipangilio, Kibodi na kipanya. Kompyuta yako ikiwa na taa ya nyuma ya skrini, kuna pia aikoni ya mwangaza: sogeza juu yake kubadilisha mwangaza, au ibofye kupata kitelezi. Chini ya hizo kuna Programu zote, kitufe cha masasisho yakiwepo, na Nishati. Nishati ina Funga skrini, Kihifadhi skrini, Lala, Hibernate (kompyuta ikiweza), Toka, Washa upya na Zima.

# Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-ring-p3 = Bofya aikoni ya sauti, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi au betri katikati na paneli ya duara inafunguka juu ya programu pendwa. Hapo unaweza kubadilisha sauti au kipaza sauti, kuunganisha vipokea sauti vya Bluetooth, kujiunga na mtandao wa Wi-Fi, au kuona betri itadumu kwa muda gani na imechakaa kiasi gani. Gia kwenye paneli inafungua ukurasa kamili wa Mipangilio. Msalaba unaifunga paneli.

# Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-ring-p4 = Programu zako pendwa zimepangwa kuzunguka katikati. Folders na Diski ziko miongoni mwao mwanzoni. Pia kuna duara nne za zana zinazofanana na programu: Picha ya skrini (kamera), Ubao wa kunakili, Arifa na Kikuza. Bofya programu ili kuifungua, au kuleta dirisha lake mbele. Programu zilizofunguliwa zinaonekana kwenye pete ya madirisha wazi kuzunguka programu pendwa, si miongoni mwa pendwa zenyewe.

# Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps": paragraph 5.
settings-help-topics-ring-p5 = Aikoni za programu nyingine zinazoendeshwa, kama programu ya mazungumzo au zana ya hifadhi rudufu, ziko kwenye safu chini ya katikati. Bofya moja ili kufungua programu yake, au ibofye kulia kupata menyu yake. Aikoni ya programu jalizi pia iko hapo. Ibofye ili kuanzisha programu jalizi, au ibofye kulia kuona inachotoa, kama Unganisha na Tenganisha kwa Flow, na mipangilio yake.

# Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps": caption and spoken name of picture 6 (ring-all.png).
settings-help-topics-ring-pic6 = Programu zote: kila programu kuzunguka nje, zimepangwa kwa aina

# Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 7.
settings-help-topics-ring-step7-1 = Bofya Programu zote katikati. Kila programu ambayo si pendwa bado inaonekana kuzunguka nje, katika sehemu kwa aina: Mtandao, Ofisi, Picha, Sauti na video, Michezo na kadhalika. Aina isiyo na programu zilizobaki haina sehemu.

# Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 7.
settings-help-topics-ring-step7-2 = Bofya programu kwenye sehemu ili kuifungua.

# Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 7.
settings-help-topics-ring-step7-3 = Unatafuta programu moja? Andika herufi chache za jina lake. Ni programu zinazolingana tu zinabaki, inayolingana zaidi ikiwa ya kwanza, na Enter inafungua ya kwanza. Escape inafuta ulichoandika.

# Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps": step 4 of the numbered steps at block 7.
settings-help-topics-ring-step7-4 = Bofya Programu zote tena ili kuficha sehemu.

# Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps": tip 8, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-ring-tip8 = Bonyeza Escape, au bofya nje ya duara, ili kufunga pete.

# Title of the Help topic "Keeping the screen awake".
settings-help-topics-awake-title = Kuiweka skrini macho

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Keeping the screen awake" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-awake-keywords = cup caffeine keep awake screen off sleep dim lock video presentation kikombe macho skrini zima lala hafifisha funga wasilisho

# Help topic "Keeping the screen awake": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-awake-p1 = Unatazama kitu, au unasoma bila kugusa kipanya? Bofya kikombe katikati ya pete. Kinawaka. Hadi utakapokibofya tena au kutoka, skrini haitafifia, kufunga, kuzimika wala kulala.

# Help topic "Keeping the screen awake": tip 2, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-awake-tip2 = Swichi hiyo hiyo iko juu ya Mipangilio, Nishati.

# Title of the Help topic "Keeping your favourite apps in the ring".
settings-help-topics-favourites-title = Kuweka programu zako pendwa kwenye pete

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Keeping your favourite apps in the ring" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-favourites-keywords = favourite favourites favorite favorites keep add remove right-click drag move order pendwa weka ongeza ondoa buruta hamisha mpangilio

# Help topic "Keeping your favourite apps in the ring": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-favourites-p1 = Bofya kulia programu yoyote, kwenye pete au kwenye Programu zote, kisha uchague Ongeza kwa pendwa. Baada ya hapo inabaki daima kuzunguka katikati ya pete. Ili kuiondoa, ibofye kulia kisha uchague Ondoa kutoka pendwa. Katikati kuna nafasi ya kumi na mbili.

# Help topic "Keeping your favourite apps in the ring": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-favourites-p2 = Unaanza na Folders na Diski. Unaweza kuondoa mojawapo na kuirudisha kutoka Programu zote.

# Help topic "Keeping your favourite apps in the ring": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-favourites-p3 = Ili kubadilisha mpangilio wa programu zako pendwa, buruta programu moja hadi kwenye nafasi ya nyingine. Programu nyingine zinasogea kupisha nafasi.

# Help topic "Keeping your favourite apps in the ring": caption and spoken name of picture 4 (ring-menu.png).
settings-help-topics-favourites-pic4 = Bofya kulia programu kupata chaguo zaidi

# Help topic "Keeping your favourite apps in the ring": paragraph 5.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-favourites-p5 = Menyu hiyo hiyo inaweza kufungua dirisha jingine la programu au kufunga madirisha yake. Kwa programu ulizoweka kutoka Programu, inaweza pia kuiondoa programu hiyo.

# Title of the Help topic "Switching between windows".
settings-help-topics-switcher-title = Kubadilisha kati ya madirisha

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Switching between windows" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-switcher-keywords = windows switch switcher alt tab open ring desktop show minimise clipboard copy paste history keyboard on screen madirisha badilisha eneo-kazi onyesha punguza ubao wa kunakili nakili bandika historia kibodi ya skrini

# Help topic "Switching between windows": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-switcher-p1 = Fungua pete na utaona madirisha yako yaliyofunguliwa kwenye pete kuzunguka programu pendwa. Kila dirisha lina sehemu yake, yenye aikoni na jina la programu yake. Elekeza moja na katikati inaonyesha picha ya dirisha hilo. Libofye kuliweka mbele, au libofye kulia kupata punguza, kuza na funga. Kubonyeza Alt na Tab pia huleta kila dirisha lililofunguliwa mbele kwa zamu.

# Help topic "Switching between windows": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-switcher-p2 = Kubonyeza Super na D kunaficha kila dirisha ili kuonyesha eneo-kazi. Zibonyeze tena kurudisha madirisha. Bila kitu kilichofunguliwa, skrini ni wazi.

# Help topic "Switching between windows": paragraph 3.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-switcher-p3 = Ubao wa kunakili ni mojawapo ya duara nne za zana kati ya programu pendwa kwenye pete. Unafunguka kama paneli ya duara na unaonyesha ulichonakili hivi karibuni, kipya kwanza. Andika kwenye kichujio kupata kipengee, bofya kimoja kukinakili tena, na viwekee pini vile unavyotaka kuhifadhi daima. Msalaba mdogo kando ya mstari unaondoa kipengee hicho tu, jambo rahisi kwa nenosiri lililonakiliwa kwa makosa. Pipa lililo chini linaondoa kila kitu isipokuwa vilivyowekewa pini. Libofye mara mbili kuthibitisha. Kuchagua mstari kunauweka tu tena kwenye ubao wa kunakili. Unabandika wewe mwenyewe, kwa hiyo hakuna kinachotua kwenye kisanduku ambacho hukuchagua. Kwenye Mipangilio, Pete, Ubao wa kunakili, unachagua lini kilichobaki kifutwe: kila kuwasha upya, baada ya siku, wiki au wiki mbili, au kamwe.

# Help topic "Switching between windows": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-switcher-p4 = Ukishawasha kibodi ya skrini kwenye Mipangilio, Kibodi na kipanya, chini ya Kitufe cha kibodi kwenye pete, inapata aikoni yake ndogo katikati ya pete. Inafungua kibodi chini ya skrini. Aikoni ile ile inaifunga tena.

# Title of the Help topic "Notifications: what programs tell you".
settings-help-topics-notifications-title = Arifa: kile programu zinachokuambia

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Notifications: what programs tell you" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-notifications-keywords = notification notifications alert message banner popup toast bell quiet silence do not disturb missed mail battery corner arifa ujumbe kengele kimya usisumbue barua pepe betri kona

# Help topic "Notifications: what programs tell you": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-notifications-p1 = Programu ikiwa na kitu cha kukuambia, kama barua pepe mpya au betri kuisha chaji, duara dogo linaonekana kwenye kona ya skrini. Linabaki sekunde chache, kisha linaondoka. Hadi tatu zinaonekana kwa wakati mmoja, moja juu ya nyingine. Zinabaki kwenye kona, kwa hiyo hakuna kinachofunika unachosoma.

# Help topic "Notifications: what programs tell you": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-notifications-p2 = Duara la Arifa kwenye pete linafungua orodha ya kila arifa, ya zamani zaidi juu na mpya zaidi chini, na saa kando ya kila moja. Ukiwa umekuwa mbali na kompyuta zinaweza kuwa nyingi, kwa hiyo orodha inafunguka chini, ambapo mpya iko. Sogeza juu kuona za zamani.

# Help topic "Notifications: what programs tell you": paragraph 3.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-notifications-p3 = Kando ya kila mstari kuna vitufe viwili vidogo. Pini inaiweka arifa hiyo daima: inahamia juu ya zingine, na kufuta kila kitu hakuiguzi. Pipa dogo linaondoa hiyo tu. Chini kuna kitufe cha kengele, kilichoelezwa hapa chini, na pipa linaloondoa kila kitu isipokuwa zilizowekewa pini. Bofya pipa hilo mara mbili kuthibitisha.

# Help topic "Notifications: what programs tell you": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-notifications-p4 = Unachagua kila moja ibaki muda gani, kwenye Mipangilio, Pete, Arifa: sekunde tatu kwa mtazamo, sekunde kumi na tano kuisoma, au hadi uifunge. Ya dharura hubaki daima hadi uifunge, ili onyo lisitoweke kabla hujalisoma.

# Help topic "Notifications: what programs tell you": paragraph 5.
settings-help-topics-notifications-p5 = Ili kuzima arifa, fungua orodha kutoka duara la Arifa kisha ubonyeze kengele iliyo chini. Mstari unaokatiza kengele unaonyesha kuwa arifa zimezimwa. Zinaacha kuonekana kwenye skrini lakini bado zinaingia kwenye orodha, kwa hiyo hutakosa chochote. Bonyeza kengele tena ili kuziwasha.

# Help topic "Notifications: what programs tell you": tip 6, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-notifications-tip6 = Msalaba kwenye arifa unaificha tu. Bado iko kwenye orodha.

# Title of the Help topic "Getting new apps".
settings-help-topics-apps-title = Kupata programu mpya

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Getting new apps" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-apps-keywords = install store apps download software flathub browser firefox brave uninstall remove update deb package chrome vs code zoom driver double-click weka duka programu pakua kivinjari ondoa sasisha kifurushi dereva

# Help topic "Getting new apps": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-apps-p1 = Trindle haikuchagulii programu zako. Unapoingia mara ya kwanza, Karibu inaonyesha kurasa chache za programu maarufu, kama vivinjari. Chagua unazotaka kisha ubonyeze Weka programu zilizochaguliwa. Unaweza kufungua Karibu tena wakati wowote kutoka Programu zote.

# Help topic "Getting new apps": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-apps-p2 = Baadaye, fungua Programu kutoka kwenye pete. Vinjari kwa aina upande wa kushoto, au tafuta juu. Bofya programu kuisoma, kisha ubonyeze mshale wa kupakua kuiweka. Ukadiriaji wake wa nyota uko chini ya jina lake, na picha zake zinasogea chini ya kitufe cha kuweka. Maoni yake yako chini zaidi, chini ya Maoni. Kitufe cha dunia kinafungua ukurasa wake kwenye Flathub.

# Help topic "Getting new apps": caption and spoken name of picture 3 (store-app.png).
settings-help-topics-apps-pic3 = Ukurasa wa programu kwenye Programu

# Help topic "Getting new apps": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 4.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-apps-step4-1 = Ili kuondoa programu, ipate kwenye Programu kisha ubonyeze pipa mara mbili. Kubonyeza mara ya kwanza kunalijaza kwa rangi ya kuangazia na kuonyesha tiki. Mara ya pili inaondoa programu.

# Help topic "Getting new apps": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 4.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-apps-step4-2 = Au ibofye kulia kwenye pete kisha uchague Ondoa.

# Help topic "Getting new apps": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-apps-step4-3 = Masasisho yameorodheshwa chini ya Masasisho kwenye Programu. Bonyeza kitufe cha kusasisha.

# Help topic "Getting new apps": tip 5, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-apps-tip5 = Programu zinawekwa kwa ajili yako tu, kwa hiyo nenosiri halihitajiki.

# Help topic "Getting new apps": paragraph 6.
settings-help-topics-apps-p6 = Baadhi ya programu hazipo kwenye Flathub. Zinachapishwa kwenye GitHub badala yake, kama AppImage au faili ya Flatpak. Kwenye Programu, andika jina kwenye kisanduku cha kutafuta. AppImage zilizoorodheshwa kwenye AppImageHub zinaonekana unapoandika, na kubonyeza Enter kunatafuta GitHub yote. Jicho linaonyesha faili za toleo jipya la programu. Mshale wa kupakua unaisakinisha mara moja.

# Help topic "Getting new apps": tip 7, shown in a box of its own.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-apps-tip7 = Flathub inakagua programu zake, lakini hakuna anayekagua programu za GitHub. Weka tu programu kutoka kwa watu unaowaamini.

# Help topic "Getting new apps": paragraph 8.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-apps-p8 = Kitufe kidogo cha duara chenye ufunguo upande wa mwisho wa kadi ya Tafuta GitHub kinafungua kisanduku cha ufunguo wa GitHub. Karibu hakika huuhitaji. Bila ufunguo, GitHub hujibu maombi 60 kwa saa kutoka kwenye kompyuta yako. Ukiwa nao, hujibu 5,000, jambo linalohusika tu ukitafuta sana. Trindle hukumbuka majibu ya GitHub kwa saa chache, kwa hiyo kutafuta kitu kile kile tena hakutumii hata ombi moja. Ukifikia kikomo, ukurasa unakuambia GitHub itajibu lini tena. Ufunguo unaiwezesha Trindle kuangalia faili za umma tu na si kingine. Haukupi njia ya kuingia kwenye akaunti yako, na huchagui ruhusa zozote unapoutengeneza.

# Help topic "Getting new apps": paragraph 9.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-apps-p9 = Baadhi ya watengenezaji hutoa programu yao kama kifurushi cha Debian badala yake. Hii ni faili inayoishia .deb. Google Chrome, VS Code, Zoom na madereva mengi ya printa huja hivi. Ikishapakuliwa, ibofye mara mbili kwenye Folders, au ifungue kutoka kwenye vipakuliwa vya kivinjari chako. Dirisha dogo linaonyesha ni nini, toleo lake, na kama tayari unayo. Bonyeza mshale wa kupakua kisha uweke nenosiri lako. Kingine chochote inachohitaji kinawekwa nayo. Ikiwa inajumuisha programu, programu inaonekana kwenye pete.

# Help topic "Getting new apps": tip 10, shown in a box of its own.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-apps-tip10 = Kifurushi kinaweza kubadilisha chochote kwenye kompyuta, kwa hiyo weka tu vile vya watengenezaji unaowaamini.

# Title of the Help topic "Programs from their makers: Claude, ChatGPT, Tailscale and more".
settings-help-topics-sources-title = Programu kutoka kwa watengenezaji wake: Claude, ChatGPT, Tailscale na zaidi

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Programs from their makers: Claude, ChatGPT, Tailscale and more" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-sources-keywords = software sources repository repo apt claude anthropic chatgpt openai codex ai tailscale syncthing jellyfin media server node nodejs github gh docker deb newer vyanzo hazina programu mpya

# Help topic "Programs from their makers: Claude, ChatGPT, Tailscale and more": paragraph 1.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-sources-p1 = Programu chache hazipo kwenye Flathub. Zinatoka kwenye vyanzo vya Debian vya watengenezaji wake wenyewe, au zinapatikana huko kwa matoleo mapya zaidi: Claude, Tailscale, Syncthing, Jellyfin, Node.js, GitHub CLI na Docker. Chochote kilichopo kwenye Flathub, vivinjari vikiwemo, kinatoka Programu kama kawaida. Kwenye Programu, chagua Vyanzo vya programu kisha ubonyeze alama ya kujumlisha kando ya kimoja. Weka nenosiri la msimamizi wako, na chanzo kinaongezwa na programu kuwekwa. Kuanzia hapo inasasishwa pamoja na masasisho ya Debian.

# Help topic "Programs from their makers: Claude, ChatGPT, Tailscale and more": paragraph 2.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-sources-p2 = Chanzo kinaweza kuweka masasisho kwa kompyuta nzima, kwa hiyo ongeza tu watengenezaji unaowaamini. Pipa linaondoa programu na chanzo chake pamoja.

# Help topic "Programs from their makers: Claude, ChatGPT, Tailscale and more": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-sources-p3 = Kwa Tailscale, bonyeza Ingia kwenye Tailscale ikishawekwa. Ukurasa wa kuingia wa Tailscale unafunguka kwenye kivinjari, na Programu inakuambia ukiwa umeunganishwa.

# Help topic "Programs from their makers: Claude, ChatGPT, Tailscale and more": tip 4, shown in a box of its own.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-sources-tip4 = Ongeza chanzo kingine kinakuwezesha kuongeza chanzo cha mtengenezaji yeyote. Tumia maelezo kutoka kwenye maelekezo yake ya kuweka: anwani yake, suite, components na ufunguo wa kusaini.

# Title of the Help topic "Undoing an update with snapshots".
settings-help-topics-snapshots-title = Kutengua sasisho kwa snapshots

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Undoing an update with snapshots" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-snapshots-keywords = snapshots snapshot restore undo rollback roll back update broke boot menu grub btrfs rudisha tengua sasisho liharibika menyu ya kuwasha

# Help topic "Undoing an update with snapshots": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-snapshots-p1 = Mfumo ukiwa kwenye Btrfs, Trindle huchukua snapshot, nakala iliyohifadhiwa ya mfumo, kabla na baada ya kila badiliko la programu: kuweka, kusasisha au kuondoa chochote kutoka Debian au chanzo cha programu. Mipangilio, Snapshots inaziorodhesha. Kamera inachukua moja sasa, kabla ya kujaribu kitu unachoweza kutaka kutengua.

# Help topic "Undoing an update with snapshots": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-snapshots-step2-1 = Fungua Mipangilio kisha uchague Snapshots.

# Help topic "Undoing an update with snapshots": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-snapshots-step2-2 = Bonyeza mshale wa kurejesha kando ya snapshot ya kabla mambo hayajaharibika, kisha ubonyeze tena kuthibitisha.

# Help topic "Undoing an update with snapshots": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-snapshots-step2-3 = Washa upya. Mfumo uko kama ulivyokuwa wakati huo. Hali ambayo ulikuwa nayo kabla tu imewekwa kando, haijafutwa.

# Help topic "Undoing an update with snapshots": paragraph 3.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-snapshots-p3 = Kompyuta isipoanza, chagua Trindle snapshots kwenye menyu ya kuwasha, kisha uchague snapshot. Inaanza kama ilivyokuwa wakati huo, lakini hakuna unachofanya pale kinachohifadhiwa. Ili kuhifadhi, rejesha snapshot kwenye Mipangilio.

# Help topic "Undoing an update with snapshots": tip 4, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-snapshots-tip4 = Menyu ya kuwasha imefichwa. Gusa Esc mara moja kompyuta inapoanza ili kuionyesha. Kushikilia Esc kunaruka menyu hadi skrini ya kuandika. Hilo likitokea, andika normal kisha ubonyeze Enter kurudisha menyu.

# Help topic "Undoing an update with snapshots": tip 5, shown in a box of its own.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-snapshots-tip5 = Trindle ikiwa imewekwa kwa kisakinishi chake, folda yako ya nyumbani ina kizigeu chake, sehemu tofauti ya diski, na imeachwa nje ya snapshots, kwa hiyo kurejesha hakubadilishi faili zako kamwe. Kompyuta hii ikiwa imepangwa tofauti, Mipangilio, Snapshots inakuambia.

# Title of the Help topic "Moving to another computer".
settings-help-topics-moving-title = Kuhamia kompyuta nyingine

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Moving to another computer" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-moving-keywords = backup back up restore move new computer transfer copy settings apps data flat fmpack hifadhi rudufu rejesha hamia kompyuta mpya nakili mipangilio programu data

# Help topic "Moving to another computer": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-moving-p1 = Kwenye Programu, chagua Hamisha programu zako. Washa unachotaka kuchukua nawe: programu zako, data zake, AppImage zako na mipangilio ya Trindle. Bonyeza kitufe cha kuhifadhi na Trindle itatengeneza faili moja ya hifadhi rudufu kwenye folda yako ya nyumbani. Iiname kwenye USB au hifadhi ya wingu.

# Help topic "Moving to another computer": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-moving-p2 = Kwenye kompyuta nyingine, fungua ukurasa ule ule, bonyeza kitufe cha kufungua kisha uchague faili. Trindle itapakua na kuweka programu kutoka Flathub, kisha irudishe data zake na mipangilio yako. Toka kisha uingie tena ili kuona kila mpangilio.

# Help topic "Moving to another computer": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-moving-p3 = Hifadhi rudufu ni aina ile ile ya faili ambayo Trindle Flat hutengeneza. Inaishia .fmpack. Hii ina maana Trindle Flat inaweza kuifungua kwenye kompyuta yoyote ya Linux, na unaweza kuchagua hapa hifadhi rudufu au orodha ya programu iliyotengenezwa na Trindle Flat. Jina Trindle Flat kwenye ukurasa ni kiungo cha tovuti yake. Programu zilizopo tayari kwenye kompyuta hii zinabaki na mipangilio yake. Ni programu ambazo hifadhi rudufu inaweka tu zinazopata mipangilio yake tena.

# Help topic "Moving to another computer": tip 4, shown in a box of its own.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-moving-tip4 = Hati zako, picha na faili nyingine hazimo kwenye hifadhi rudufu, kwa hiyo ziiname mwenyewe. Manenosiri ya Wi-Fi na ufunguo wako wa GitHub pia hayamo.

# Title of the Help topic "Connecting to Wi-Fi".
