# Title of the Help topic "Screen size and displays".
settings-help-topics-display-title = Ukubwa wa skrini na maonyesho

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Screen size and displays" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-display-keywords = screen display size bigger smaller text zoom scale resolution monitor rotate night light warm blue light evening eyes skrini onyesho ukubwa kubwa ndogo maandishi kuza mwonekano mzunguko mwanga wa usiku joto mwanga wa buluu jioni macho

# Help topic "Screen size and displays": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-display-p1 = Vitu vikionekana vidogo mno au vikubwa mno, fungua Mipangilio kisha uchague Onyesho, halafu ubadilishe Ukubwa. 100% ni ukubwa wa kawaida kwa skrini yako.

# Help topic "Screen size and displays": caption and spoken name of picture 2 (settings-display.png).
settings-help-topics-display-pic2 = Ukurasa wa Onyesho

# Help topic "Screen size and displays": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-display-p3 = Baada ya badiliko, ujumbe unauliza kama unataka kulibakisha. Usipofanya chochote kwa sekunde kumi na tano, skrini inarudi ilivyokuwa, kwa hiyo chaguo baya haliwezi kukukwamisha.

# Help topic "Screen size and displays": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-display-p4 = Mwanga wa usiku, chini ya ukurasa huo huo, unaifanya skrini iwe na joto zaidi jioni, ikiwa na mwanga mdogo wa buluu unaoweza kukuweka macho. Ukiuwasha unafuata machweo na macheo, ambayo Trindle inakokotoa kutoka kwenye saa za eneo lako, kwa hiyo haikuulizi uko wapi kamwe. Chagua Weka nyakati badala yake ili kuchagua unapoanza na kuisha. Sogeza Joto kulia kwa skrini yenye joto zaidi.

# Title of the Help topic "NVIDIA graphics, and making them faster".
settings-help-topics-nvidia-title = Kuongeza kasi ya picha za NVIDIA

# Words people might search for the Help topic "NVIDIA graphics, and making them faster" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-nvidia-keywords = nvidia graphics card driver nouveau open slow speed gpu secure boot proprietary geforce kadi ya picha dereva wazi polepole kasi

# Help topic "NVIDIA graphics, and making them faster": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-nvidia-p1 = Kwenye kila kadi ya NVIDIA, Trindle inaanza na nouveau, dereva wazi inayokuja na Linux. Huhitaji kuweka wala kuamua chochote. Eneo-kazi linafanya kazi tangu kuanza kwa kwanza.

# Help topic "NVIDIA graphics, and making them faster": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-nvidia-p2 = Kwenye kadi ya zamani, hiyo inatosha. Kwenye kadi ya kuanzia takriban 2022, dereva wazi haiwezi kupandisha kasi ya kadi juu ya kiwango chake cha chini kabisa. Eneo-kazi bado linafanya kazi lakini linahisi zito, na video inaweza kukwama. Dereva ya NVIDIA yenyewe inatatua hilo.

# Help topic "NVIDIA graphics, and making them faster": tip 3, shown in a box of its own.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-nvidia-tip3 = Kompyuta yako ikihisi vizuri, iache ilivyo. Kubadilisha dereva ya picha ndiyo njia ya kawaida zaidi ya kuishia na skrini isiyowaka.

# Help topic "NVIDIA graphics, and making them faster": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-nvidia-p4 = Ili kuweka dereva ya NVIDIA yenyewe, fungua terminal kutoka kwenye pete kisha uandike mistari miwili iliyo hapa chini, mmoja baada ya mwingine. Apt ikisema kifurushi "is not installable", sakinisha masasisho ya Trindle kwanza, kisha andika mistari yote miwili tena:

# Help topic "NVIDIA graphics, and making them faster": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 5.
settings-help-topics-nvidia-step5-1 = sudo apt update

# Help topic "NVIDIA graphics, and making them faster": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 5.
settings-help-topics-nvidia-step5-2 = sudo apt install nvidia-driver

# Help topic "NVIDIA graphics, and making them faster": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 5.
settings-help-topics-nvidia-step5-3 = Usiwashe upya bado. Soma sehemu inayofuata kwanza.

# Help topic "NVIDIA graphics, and making them faster": paragraph 6.
settings-help-topics-nvidia-p6 = Debian hujenga dereva kwa kernel yako inaposakinisha. Hii huchukua dakika chache na husakinisha kikusanyaji, zana ya kujenga programu. Dereva hujijenga upya kernel inaposasishwa.

# Help topic "NVIDIA graphics, and making them faster": paragraph 10.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-nvidia-p10 = Ili kurudi kwenye dereva wazi wakati wowote, endesha sudo apt remove nvidia-driver, kisha uwashe upya.

# Title of the Help topic "Making the screen bigger where you are looking".
settings-help-topics-magnifier-title = Kukuza skrini mahali unapotazama

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Making the screen bigger where you are looking" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-magnifier-keywords = magnifier magnify zoom bigger larger reading glasses eyesight sight small print loupe accessibility kikuza kuza kubwa kusoma miwani macho uwezo wa kuona maandishi madogo

# Help topic "Making the screen bigger where you are looking": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-magnifier-p1 = Kikuza kinaonyesha duara lililokuzwa popote unapobonyeza, ili usome maandishi madogo bila kubadilisha chochote kwenye skrini yenyewe.

# Help topic "Making the screen bigger where you are looking": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-magnifier-step2-1 = Bofya duara la Kikuza kwenye pete.

# Help topic "Making the screen bigger where you are looking": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-magnifier-step2-2 = Shikilia popote kwenye skrini kwa kidole au kitufe cha kipanya. Duara linaonekana likionyesha kila kilicho chini yake kikiwa kikubwa zaidi.

# Help topic "Making the screen bigger where you are looking": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-magnifier-step2-3 = Endelea kushikilia na usogee. Duara linakufuata, ili uweze kusoma kwenye mstari.

# Help topic "Making the screen bigger where you are looking": step 4 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-magnifier-step2-4 = Achia na duara linatoweka. Bonyeza kitufe cha kikuza tena ukimaliza.

# Help topic "Making the screen bigger where you are looking": tip 3, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-magnifier-tip3 = Kikuza kikiwa kimewashwa, skrini iliyo chini inabaki tuli na haiwezi kubofyewa, kwa hiyo huwezi kuanzisha kitu kwa bahati mbaya ukisoma.

# Title of the Help topic "Picking a colour from the screen".
settings-help-topics-eye-dropper-title = Kuchukua rangi kutoka kwenye skrini

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Picking a colour from the screen" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-eye-dropper-keywords = eye dropper eyedropper colour color pick picker hex code copy swatch screen kidondoshi rangi chukua msimbo nakili skrini

# Help topic "Picking a colour from the screen": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-eye-dropper-p1 = Kidondoshi cha rangi kinasoma rangi ya nukta yoyote moja kwenye skrini na kunakili msimbo wake, kama #FBC711, ili uweze kuubandika kwenye hati au muundo.

# Help topic "Picking a colour from the screen": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-eye-dropper-step2-1 = Bofya duara la Kidondoshi cha rangi kwenye pete, lile lenye kidondoshi juu yake.

# Help topic "Picking a colour from the screen": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-eye-dropper-step2-2 = Skrini inabaki tuli, na duara lililokuzwa linaonekana karibu na kielekezi ili uweze kulenga nukta moja.

# Help topic "Picking a colour from the screen": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-eye-dropper-step2-3 = Bofya nukta unayotaka. Bonyeza Esc badala yake ili kughairi.

# Help topic "Picking a colour from the screen": step 4 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-eye-dropper-step2-4 = Msimbo unanakiliwa mara moja na kuongezwa juu ya orodha, mpya kwanza.

# Help topic "Picking a colour from the screen": tip 3, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-eye-dropper-tip3 = Rangi zilizochukuliwa awali zinabaki kwenye orodha, kwa hiyo unaweza kunakili moja tena baadaye bila kuichukua upya.

# Title of the Help topic "Taking a picture of the screen".
settings-help-topics-screenshots-title = Kupiga picha ya skrini

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Taking a picture of the screen" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-screenshots-keywords = screenshot screen shot print prtsc super shift s picture capture grab snip area part copy paste clipboard picha ya skrini nasa eneo sehemu nakili bandika ubao wa kunakili

# Help topic "Taking a picture of the screen": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-screenshots-p1 = Bonyeza kitufe cha Print. Kama kibodi yako haina kitufe hicho, bonyeza Super, Shift na S. Unaweza pia kubofya duara la Picha ya skrini (kamera) kwenye pete. Pete inajifunga kwanza ili isiwe kwenye picha. Kisha skrini inabaki tuli na inakuwa hafifu kidogo. Buruta kwenye sehemu unayotaka, au tumia vitufe viwili vya duara chini: kimoja cha skrini nzima, na kimoja cha kufunga. Elekeza kielekezi juu ya kitufe kuona jina lake.

# Help topic "Taking a picture of the screen": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-screenshots-step2-1 = Kwa skrini nzima, bonyeza kitufe cha skrini.

# Help topic "Taking a picture of the screen": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-screenshots-step2-2 = Kwa sehemu, bonyeza mraba wa vitone, kisha uburute kwenye sehemu unayotaka. Picha inapigwa unapoachia.

# Help topic "Taking a picture of the screen": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-screenshots-step2-3 = Umebadili mawazo? Bonyeza msalaba, au Esc.

# Help topic "Taking a picture of the screen": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-screenshots-p3 = Trindle inahifadhi picha kwenye Picha, ndani ya folda iitwayo Screenshots. Jina la faili lina tarehe na saa. Trindle pia inanakili picha, ili uweze kuibandika moja kwa moja kwenye barua pepe au hati. Hakuna kinachoonekana ikifanya kazi. Unaona ujumbe tu kukiwa na tatizo.

# Help topic "Taking a picture of the screen": tip 4, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-screenshots-tip4 = Shift na Print zinapiga skrini nzima mara moja, bila kuuliza.

# Title of the Help topic "Having the screen read aloud".
settings-help-topics-screen-reader-title = Kusomewa skrini kwa sauti

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Having the screen read aloud" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-screen-reader-keywords = screen reader blind read aloud speak speech voice sight eyesight accessibility kisomaji cha skrini kipofu soma kwa sauti sema usemi sauti kuona

# Help topic "Having the screen read aloud": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-screen-reader-p1 = Hakuna kisomaji cha skrini kilichowekwa, kwa hiyo swichi ya Soma skrini kwa sauti kwenye Mipangilio, Mwonekano, chini ya Kusoma skrini, imefifishwa, ikiwa na maelezo yanayosema hivyo.

# Help topic "Having the screen read aloud": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-screen-reader-p2 = Kisomaji cha skrini kikiwa tayari, kubonyeza Super, Alt na S pamoja kutakiwasha na kukizima kutoka popote. Hilo linafanya kazi hata wakati kompyuta inaanza kwa mara ya kwanza kabisa, wakati hakuna kitu cha kuona wala kubofya. Hadi hapo, vitufe hivyo vinafungua Mipangilio kwenye swichi hiyo.

# Title of the Help topic "Wallpaper".
settings-help-topics-wallpaper-title = Mandhari

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Wallpaper" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-wallpaper-keywords = wallpaper background picture photo slideshow change tiles pictures folder add remove skip mandhari usuli picha badilisha vigae folda ongeza ondoa ruka

# Help topic "Wallpaper": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-wallpaper-p1 = Fungua Mipangilio kisha uchague Mandhari. Picha zinazokuja na Trindle zinaonyeshwa kama vigae vidogo, na ile iliyo kwenye skrini sasa iko kwenye onyesho kubwa upande wa kulia.

# Help topic "Wallpaper": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-wallpaper-step2-1 = Bonyeza kigae ili kuweka picha hiyo kwenye skrini.

# Help topic "Wallpaper": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-wallpaper-step2-2 = Kibonyeze tena ili kuiacha nje. Kigae kinafifia, na picha hiyo inarukwa kuanzia hapo. Bonyeza mara moja zaidi kuirudisha.

# Help topic "Wallpaper": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-wallpaper-step2-3 = Ongeza yako mwenyewe kwa Chagua picha, au tumia Chagua folda kwa folda yako mwenyewe.

# Help topic "Wallpaper": step 4 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-wallpaper-step2-4 = Washa Badilisha picha mara kwa mara, kisha uchague mara ngapi. Ni picha ambazo hujaziacha nje tu ndizo zinazotumika.

# Help topic "Wallpaper": tip 3, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-wallpaper-tip3 = Kuacha picha nje hakuifuti kamwe. Kigae kinabaki pale, kimefifia, ili ubadili mawazo.

# Help topic "Wallpaper": caption and spoken name of picture 4 (settings-wallpaper.png).
settings-help-topics-wallpaper-pic4 = Ukurasa wa Mandhari

# Title of the Help topic "Colours, icons and text".
settings-help-topics-look-title = Rangi, aikoni na maandishi

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Colours, icons and text" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-look-keywords = colour colours color colors accent theme dark light mode sunshine bright font text icons cursor pointer look rangi mandhari-mada giza angavu jua fonti maandishi aikoni kielekezi mwonekano

# Help topic "Colours, icons and text": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-look-p1 = Fungua Mipangilio kisha uchague Mwonekano. Chini ya Mada, mada yenye sura ya giza na ya angavu ina vitufe viwili kando ya picha yake, Giza na Angavu. Bonyeza Angavu skrini ikiwa ngumu kuona kwenye jua kali, na Giza tena baadaye. Kila kitu kinabadilika mara moja, isipokuwa programu zilizowekwa kutoka Programu, ambazo hubadilika zitakapofunguliwa mara ijayo. Mada yenye sura moja tu, kama Midnight (giza) au Paper (angavu), haina vitufe hivyo. Ili kubadilisha kati ya giza na angavu hapo, chagua mada nyingine.

# Help topic "Colours, icons and text": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-look-p2 = Rangi ya kuangazia hutumika kwa vitufe, swichi na kuonyesha mahali ulipo. Chagua mojawapo ya rangi ishirini au andika yako mwenyewe.

# Help topic "Colours, icons and text": caption and spoken name of picture 3 (settings-appearance.png).
settings-help-topics-look-pic3 = Ukurasa wa Mwonekano

# Help topic "Colours, icons and text": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-look-p4 = Chini ya Aikoni, chagua Duara au Miraba. Zote ni Aikoni za Trindle: kila moja inaonyesha alama ya programu kwa nyeupe juu ya rangi yake, ya duara au ya mraba wenye pembe laini, na inaonekana sawa kwenye angavu na giza. Trindle huanza na duara. Seti isipokuwa na aikoni ya programu bado, picha ya programu yenyewe huonyeshwa juu ya duara au mraba mweupe, ili ifae.

# Help topic "Colours, icons and text": paragraph 5.
settings-help-topics-look-p5 = Ukurasa huo huo unabadilisha fonti na ukubwa wa kielekezi. Unaweza pia kuongeza fonti yako mwenyewe: angalia kuongeza fonti.

# Help topic "Colours, icons and text": paragraph 6.
settings-help-topics-look-p6 = Mada inabadilisha mwonekano wote mara moja: angalia mada. Ili kubadilisha vitu zaidi kwa mkono, kama vivuli, pembe au usuli wa Programu, angalia kubadilisha mwonekano kwa karatasi ya mtindo.

# Title of the Help topic "Adding fonts of your own".
settings-help-topics-themes-title = Kuongeza fonti zako mwenyewe

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Adding fonts of your own" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-themes-keywords = font fonts ttf otf ttc zip add upload install typeface letters fonti ongeza weka herufi

# Help topic "Adding fonts of your own": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-themes-p1 = Kwenye Mipangilio, Mwonekano, unaweza kuongeza fonti uliyoipakua, ili usibaki na zile zinazokuja na Trindle tu. Iongeze chini ya Maandishi, na inaonekana kwenye orodha ya Fonti pale.

# Help topic "Adding fonts of your own": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-themes-p2 = Fonti ni faili ya .ttf, .otf au .ttc, au zip yenye baadhi yake. Trindle inanakili kila fonti inayopata kwenye folda yako ya fonti, na kisha zinaonekana kwenye orodha ya Fonti. Ili kuweka fonti kwa kila anayetumia kompyuta, tumia Programu badala yake.

# Help topic "Adding fonts of your own": tip 3, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-themes-tip3 = Hakuna unachoongeza kinachotumwa popote, na hakuna kilichopo tayari kwenye kompyuta kinachobadilishwa.

# Title of the Help topic "Themes: a whole look from one file".
settings-help-topics-theme-files-title = Mada: mwonekano mzima kutoka faili moja

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Themes: a whole look from one file" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-theme-files-keywords = theme themes look skin file css add share make own glass dark light keep go back undo thirty seconds footer safe default trial mada mwonekano faili ongeza shiriki tengeneza giza angavu hifadhi rudi tengua sekunde thelathini salama chaguo-msingi jaribio

# Help topic "Themes: a whole look from one file": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-theme-files-p1 = Mada ni mwonekano mzima, ikiwemo rangi, pembe, ukubwa na nafasi, ukiwekwa kwenye faili moja. Kwenye Mipangilio, Mwonekano, Mada, kila mada inaonyeshwa kama picha ndogo iliyochorwa kwa rangi zake yenyewe. Mwonekano wa Trindle wenyewe, buluu nzito ya usiku, daima uko wa kwanza kwenye orodha na hauwezi kuondolewa kamwe. Midnight, inayokuja na Trindle, ni nyeusi na kijivu bila buluu ndani yake. Hivyo ndivyo mwonekano wa Trindle wenyewe ulivyokuwa zamani.

# Help topic "Themes: a whole look from one file": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-theme-files-step2-1 = Bonyeza mada ili kuijaribu. Kila dirisha la Trindle linabadilika mara moja. Mada ikiwa na sura ya giza na ya angavu, Giza na Angavu vinaonekana kando ya picha yake. Bonyeza mojawapo badala yake ili kujaribu mada kwa sura hiyo. Kwenye mada unayoitumia tayari, vinabadilisha sura mara moja, bila kuhitaji kuthibitisha.

# Help topic "Themes: a whole look from one file": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-theme-files-step2-2 = Kisanduku cha Weka kinaonekana chini ya dirisha. Kinabaki kikionekana hata uwe umeshuka umbali gani kwenye ukurasa. Bonyeza Weka ndani ya sekunde 30 ili kubakiza mwonekano mpya. Usipofanya chochote, au ukibonyeza Tengua sasa au Escape, mwonekano wako wa zamani unarudi wenyewe, kila mahali, hata Mipangilio ikiwa imefungwa.

# Help topic "Themes: a whole look from one file": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-theme-files-step2-3 = Ili kuongeza mada aliyoshiriki mtu, bonyeza Ongeza mada kisha uchague faili yake ya .css. Trindle inaikagua kwanza. Isipoweza kuitumia mada hiyo, inaonyesha ni mstari gani una tatizo na kwa nini.

# Help topic "Themes: a whole look from one file": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-theme-files-p3 = Faili ya mada imeandikwa kama karatasi ya Trindle yenyewe (angalia kubadilisha mwonekano kwa karatasi ya mtindo). Ina kizuizi cha :root { "{" } { "}" } chenye majina yoyote yale yale, kama --trindle-page: #101820;. Juu yake inaweza kusema ni nani, kwa kutumia --trindle-theme-name, --trindle-theme-about (mstari mmoja), --trindle-theme-author na --trindle-theme-version. Inaweza kusema ni sura zipi ilizonazo kwa --trindle-theme-look: dark; light; au both;. Chochote inachoacha kinabaki kama Trindle ilivyo nacho. Mada unazoongeza zinahifadhiwa kwenye folda ya themes, ndani ya folda ya trindle kwenye folda yako ya .config. Kuondoa moja kutoka hapo kunaiondoa kwenye orodha.

# Help topic "Themes: a whole look from one file": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-theme-files-p4 = Mada yenye sura zote mbili inazihifadhi kwenye faili moja. Thamani zake za giza zinaandikwa kwenye :root { "{" } { "}" } kama kawaida, na zile za angavu kwenye kizuizi cha pili, @media (prefers-color-scheme: light) { "{" } :root { "{" } { "}" } { "}" }, kama karatasi ya Trindle yenyewe inavyofanya. Kipe kizuizi cha angavu kila rangi na kivuli ambacho sura ya giza inaweka, la sivyo za giza zitaonekana kwenye sura ya angavu. Mipangilio kisha inaonyesha Giza na Angavu kando ya picha ya mada. Mada inayosema giza au angavu ina sura hiyo moja tu, daima inachorwa nayo, na haina vitufe hivyo. Mada isiposema, Trindle inaichukulia kuwa na sura zote mbili ikiwa ina kizuizi cha angavu, na kuwa ya giza ikiwa haina. Programu nyingine zinaambiwa sura ambayo mada yako inachorwa nayo kweli, kwa hiyo mada angavu inazifanya ziwe angavu.

# Help topic "Themes: a whole look from one file": paragraph 5.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-theme-files-p5 = Mandhari ni salama kujaribu, hata aliyeitengeneza awe nani. Trindle huisoma tu kama orodha ya thamani na haiiendeshi kamwe, na haiwezi kuleta faili nyingine wala kufikia intaneti. Trindle huchukua thamani inazozijua tu, na huweka kila moja ndani ya mipaka yake. Kwa hiyo hakuna mandhari inayoweza kuficha kitufe, swali au onyo, wala kufanya maandishi kuwa madogo mno kusomeka. Maneno hubaki wazi vya kutosha kusomeka kwa rangi zozote, nyekundu hubaki nyekundu, na rangi yako ya kuangazia hubaki yako. Mandhari hubadilisha madirisha yako tu. Skrini ya kuingia hutumia mwonekano wa Trindle kila wakati.

# Help topic "Themes: a whole look from one file": tip 6, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-theme-files-tip6 = Mwonekano ukiharibika na huwezi kupata njia ya kurudi, fungua terminal, au kiweko cha maandishi kwa Ctrl, Alt na F3, kisha uandike: trindle-settings --theme default

# Title of the Help topic "Changing the look with a style sheet".
settings-help-topics-theming-title = Kubadilisha mwonekano kwa karatasi ya mtindo

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Changing the look with a style sheet" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-theming-keywords = theme theming style sheet stylesheet css colours colors shadows corners rounder bigger text size buttons background page store look custom own retheme mada karatasi ya mtindo rangi vivuli pembe maandishi ukubwa vitufe usuli ukurasa mwonekano

# Help topic "Changing the look with a style sheet": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-theming-p1 = Kila kitu ambacho Trindle inachora kinatoka kwenye karatasi moja ya mtindo, iliyoandikwa kama kurasa za wavuti zinavyopambwa. Hiyo inajumuisha rangi, vivuli, pembe, nafasi kati ya vitu, ukubwa wa vitufe, na ukubwa na unene wa maneno. Wewe, au AI unayemwomba, mnaweza kubadilisha chochote kwa karatasi yako mwenyewe.

# Help topic "Changing the look with a style sheet": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-theming-step2-1 = Tengeneza faili iitwayo style.css kwenye folda ya trindle ndani ya folda yako ya .config. Folders inaionyesha tu ukionyesha faili zilizofichwa.

# Help topic "Changing the look with a style sheet": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-theming-step2-2 = Weka tu unachotaka kubadilisha, ndani ya :root { "{" } { "}" }. Kwa mfano, --trindle-page: #101010; inapa kila dirisha ukurasa unaokaribia kuwa mweusi, --trindle-highlight: #4bae4f; inafanya vitufe viwe vya kijani, na --trindle-card-corner: 16; inafanya kadi ziwe na pembe za mviringo zaidi.

# Help topic "Changing the look with a style sheet": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-theming-step2-3 = Ihifadhi. Kila dirisha la Trindle, pete na pau za vichwa vinabadilika mara moja.

# Help topic "Changing the look with a style sheet": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-theming-p3 = Kila jina unaloweza kutumia limeorodheshwa kwenye karatasi ya Trindle yenyewe, /usr/share/trindle/style.css. Kando ya kila moja kuna maelezo ya kile inachofanya na mipaka yake, kama (6 hadi 18). Mabadiliko ya sura ya angavu yanaandikwa tu ndani ya kizuizi cha @media (prefers-color-scheme: light) { "{" } :root { "{" } { "}" } { "}" }, kama kwenye karatasi ya Trindle. Vivuli vinaandikwa kama ukurasa wa wavuti unavyoviandika, kama 0 8px 20px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8). Kadi zina kivuli laini mwanzoni. --trindle-card-shadow: none; inazifanya tambarare, na --trindle-edge: transparent; inaondoa ukingo wake mwembamba.

# Help topic "Changing the look with a style sheet": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-theming-p4 = Hakuna unachoandika kinachoweza kuvunja dirisha. Trindle inapuuza majina isiyoyajua, inabadilisha thamani isiyoweza kuisoma na yake yenyewe, na inaweka ukubwa ndani ya mipaka yake. Rangi ni juu yako, na Trindle inazihifadhi kama ulivyoziandika. Inabadilisha maneno yake yenyewe ili uweze kuyasoma kwenye kurasa, kadi na pau za kichwa zako. Rangi iliyowekwa kwa sura ya angavu pekee inatumika kwenye sura ya angavu tu. Rangi inayoonekana kupitia inakaguliwa juu ya nyeusi na nyeupe zote mbili, kwa sababu Trindle haiwezi kujua kitakachoonekana kupitia hiyo. Kama hakuna rangi ya maneno inayoweza kusomeka kwenye zako zote, Trindle inatumia nyeusi au nyeupe. Vitu vitatu vinabaki vikisomeka kila wakati: maneno mekundu kuhusu kushindwa, maneno juu ya rangi yako ya kuangazia, na visanduku vya nenosiri, ambavyo daima vinatumia mwonekano wa Trindle wenyewe. Rangi zako zikiwa ngumu mno kusoma, Mipangilio, Mwonekano inasema "Baadhi ya rangi ni ngumu kusoma." na kuziacha kama ulivyoziandika. Maneno uliyoweka mwenyewe yakiwa magumu kusoma, futa faili na mwonekano wa Trindle wenyewe unarudi mara moja. Faili lazima iwe faili ya kawaida ya maandishi isiyozidi KB 256. Isipokuwa hivyo, Trindle haitumii, na Mipangilio, Mwonekano inakuambia.

# Help topic "Changing the look with a style sheet": paragraph 5.
settings-help-topics-theming-p5 = Karatasi yako mwenyewe inawekwa juu ya mada yoyote iliyochaguliwa, kwa hiyo badiliko lako dogo linabaki ukibadilisha mada. Kwa mwonekano mzima wa kuhifadhi au kushiriki, tengeneza mada badala yake; angalia mada.

# Help topic "Changing the look with a style sheet": tip 6, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-theming-tip6 = Rangi iliyowekwa kwenye karatasi yako kwa --trindle-highlight inashinda rangi ya kuangazia iliyochaguliwa kwenye Mipangilio, Mwonekano.

# Title of the Help topic "Voice control".
settings-help-topics-voice-title = Udhibiti wa sauti

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Voice control" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-voice-keywords = voice speak talk microphone commands whisper listen say sauti sema ongea kipaza sauti amri sikiliza

# Help topic "Voice control": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-voice-p1 = Udhibiti wa sauti ni nyongeza ya hiari. Ili kuuongeza, fungua Mipangilio, chagua Pete, kisha ubonyeze Ongeza udhibiti kwa sauti. Inachukua dakika chache na takriban MB 150.

# Help topic "Voice control": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-voice-p2 = Kisha fungua pete, gusa katikati yake popote pasipo na kitufe, kisha uongee. Trindle inaacha kusikiliza ukiacha kuongea, au unaweza kugusa tena ili kuisimamisha. Hii inafanya kazi kwa kidole pamoja na kipanya. Haya ni baadhi ya mambo unayoweza kusema:

# Help topic "Voice control": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 3.
settings-help-topics-voice-step3-1 = Jina la programu, kama “Firefox” au “folders”.

# Help topic "Voice control": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 3.
settings-help-topics-voice-step3-2 = “Badilisha kwenda” programu, au “funga dirisha”.

# Help topic "Voice control": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 3.
settings-help-topics-voice-step3-3 = “Sauti juu”, “sauti chini”, “nyamazisha”.

# Help topic "Voice control": step 4 of the numbered steps at block 3.
settings-help-topics-voice-step3-4 = “Mipangilio ya Wi-Fi”, “mipangilio ya betri”, au ukurasa mwingine wowote wa mipangilio.

# Help topic "Voice control": step 5 of the numbered steps at block 3.
settings-help-topics-voice-step3-5 = “Weka” na jina la programu, ili kuitafuta kwenye Programu.

# Help topic "Voice control": step 6 of the numbered steps at block 3.
settings-help-topics-voice-step3-6 = “Mandhari inayofuata”, “picha ya skrini”, “saa ngapi”.

# Help topic "Voice control": tip 4, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-voice-tip4 = Trindle inaelewa sauti yako kwenye kompyuta hii, na hakuna kinachotumwa popote. Unaweza kuzima udhibiti wa sauti kwenye ukurasa wa Pete bila kuuondoa.

# Title of the Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones".
settings-help-topics-files-title = Folders, vifaa vya USB na simu

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-files-keywords = folders files file manager usb stick drive phone camera nas network share sharing samba disks eject format extract unpack zip compress archive rar 7z tar iso disc image password terminal f4 root wallpaper copy path location preview space bar emblem badge resize rotate picture columns music photo pdf keys keyboard shortcuts tab tabs new window faili kidhibiti cha faili simu kamera mtandao shiriki diski toa fomati fungua zip bana hifadhi nenosiri mandhari nakili njia eneo hakiki picha safu muziki njia za mkato kichupo dirisha jipya

# Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-files-p1 = Folders ni kidhibiti cha faili, mojawapo ya programu zilizo kuzunguka pete. Vifaa vya USB, simu na kamera unavyochomeka vinaonekana upande wake wa kushoto, na pia folda zilizoshirikiwa kwenye mtandao wako wa ndani chini ya Mtandao.

# Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-files-p2 = Folders inafunguka na kidirisha kimoja kinachoonyesha folda yako ya Nyumbani, na Vilivyopakuliwa na Hati vimebandikwa upande wa kushoto. Swichi ya Kimoja na Viwili juu kushoto (au F3) inaongeza kidirisha cha pili. Kidirisha cha pili kinaonyesha Za hivi karibuni isipokuwa uchague mahali pengine kwenye mipangilio ya Folders yenyewe. Fungua mipangilio hiyo kwa gia mwishoni mwa upau wa juu (au Ctrl na koma). Humo unaweza kuweka kila kidirisha kinapoanzia, kama visanduku vya kuchagua faili vionyeshwe, kama viendelezi vya faili vionyeshwe, na kama kifaa cha hifadhi kifunguke mara tu unapokichomeka. Kila kidirisha kina safu yake ya vichupo juu ya orodha yake. Upau wa juu una vitufe tu vinavyobadilisha jinsi folda inavyoonekana, pamoja na Tengua na Folda mpya. Kila unachoweza kufanya na faili ulizochagua, kama Badilisha jina, Kata, Nakili, Hamisha kwenye Tupio, Futa kabisa na Futa kwa usalama, kiko kwenye menyu ya kubofya kulia, na kila kimoja bado kina kitufe chake.

# Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-files-p3 = Kwenye menyu ya kubofya kulia, Fungua kwa programu nyingine inaorodhesha programu zinazoweza kufungua faili. Bofya mara mbili moja, au bonyeza Enter juu yake, ili kufungua faili nayo mara moja. Tiki inafanya vivyo hivyo.

# Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-files-p4 = Unapochomeka kifaa cha USB au kadi ya kumbukumbu, mstari wenye kitufe cha Fungua unaonekana kwenye pete. Bonyeza Fungua ili kuona faili zake kwenye Folders. Kifaa kikiwa kimefungwa, kinaomba kaulisiri kwanza. Folders pia inakiorodhesha chini ya Vifaa vya hifadhi ukibonyeza Fungua au la, na kitufe cha duara cha Toa kinachokiondoa kwa usalama. Ili Folders ifungue vifaa vya hifadhi kwa ajili yako, washa “Fungua vifaa vya hifadhi vikichomekwa” kwenye mipangilio ya Folders yenyewe, chini ya Vifaa vya hifadhi. Kifaa kilichochomekwa skrini ikiwa imefungwa kinasubiri hadi uifungue.

# Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones": paragraph 5.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-files-p5 = Bofya kulia kwenye Folders kupata zaidi: Toa hapa na Toa kwenye folda kwa kumbukumbu zilizobanwa, Bana kutengeneza .zip au .tar, Fungua kwenye Terminal, Fungua kama Root, Nakili eneo, na Weka kama mandhari kwenye picha. Folders inafungua kumbukumbu zilizobanwa yenyewe. Bofya mara mbili .zip, .7z, .rar au .tar, taswira ya diski (.iso), au karibu aina nyingine yoyote, nayo inafunguka kama folda, ili uweze kuangalia ndani na kutoa unachotaka tu. Kama .zip au .7z imefungwa kwa nenosiri, Folders inaliomba. Haikumbuki nenosiri, kwa hiyo inaliuliza tena mara ijayo. Folders haiwezi kufungua .rar iliyofungwa kwa nenosiri, na inakuambia hivyo.

# Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones": paragraph 6.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-files-p6 = Bonyeza upau wa nafasi kwenye faili ili kuitazama bila kuifungua, na uibonyeze tena ili kufunga onyesho la awali. F4 inafungua terminal kwenye folda uliyomo. Bofya kulia folda au faili kisha uchague Bandika kwenye pete ili kuiweka kuzunguka katikati ya pete pamoja na programu zako pendwa, ambapo kubofya mara moja kunaifungua. Ili kuiondoa, ibofye kulia hapo. Bofya kulia picha ili kubadilisha ukubwa au kuzungusha. Kwenye Sifa za faili unaweza kuipa alama ndogo. Kwenye Sifa za folda unaweza kuishiriki na kompyuta nyingine kwenye mtandao wa ndani uleule (kwenye mtandao wa mkahawa au ofisi, hiyo inamaanisha kila mtu mwingine aliye juu yake). Mara ya kwanza, Folders inawasha Samba, ambayo inaomba nenosiri lako, na kushiriki kunafanya kazi baada ya kompyuta kuwashwa upya. Kwenye mwonekano wa orodha, bofya kulia vichwa vya safu ili kuongeza maelezo ya muziki, picha na PDF.

# Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones": paragraph 7.
settings-help-topics-files-p7 = Kila jina kwenye njia iliyo juu lina mshale mdogo baada yake. Bonyeza mshale ili kuona folda zilizo ndani ya folda hiyo, kisha uchague moja ili kwenda huko. Bofya folda kwa kitufe cha kati, au shikilia Ctrl na ubofye mara mbili, ili kuifungua kwenye kichupo kipya nyuma ya kile ulichopo. Bofya kichupo kwa kitufe cha kati ili kukifunga. Buruta folda kati ya folda mbili zilizobandikwa upande wa kushoto ili kuibandika hapo, na uburute folda zilizobandikwa juu na chini ili kuzipanga upendavyo. Chini ya kisanduku cha Tafuta kuna orodha tatu, Aina, Ukubwa na Ilibadilishwa. Zichague ili kupunguza kinachoonyeshwa mara moja.

# Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones": paragraph 8.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-files-p8 = Vitufe ni vile vya kawaida vya kidhibiti cha faili. Alt na Kushoto zinarudi nyuma, Alt na Kulia mbele, na Alt na Juu au Backspace juu folda moja. Ctrl na L, au Alt na D, zinakuwezesha kuandika mahali. Ctrl na T inafungua kichupo, na Ctrl na W inakifunga (na dirisha, likiwa kichupo cha mwisho). Ctrl na Tab inaenda kwenye kichupo kinachofuata, na Ctrl, Shift na Tab kwenye kilichotangulia. Ctrl na N inafungua dirisha jingine. Ctrl na F inatafuta, F2 inabadilisha jina, F5 inaonyesha folda upya, Delete inahamisha faili kwenye Tupio na Shift na Delete inaifuta kabisa. Ctrl, Shift na N inatengeneza folda. Ctrl na A inachagua yote, Ctrl, Shift na A haichagui chochote, na Ctrl na I inabadilishana kilichochaguliwa na kisichochaguliwa. Alt na Enter inafungua Sifa. F3 inabadilisha kati ya kidirisha kimoja na viwili, na F4 inafungua terminal.

# Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones": paragraph 9.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-files-p9 = Vifaa vya hifadhi vinaonyesha kila kifaa na nafasi iliyobaki. Utavipata kwenye Programu zote na kwenye Mipangilio, Kuhusu kompyuta hii. Kutoka hapo unaweza kufungua kifaa cha USB, kukitoa kwa usalama kabla ya kukichomoa, au kukifomati. Trindle haitoi kamwe chaguo la kufomati kifaa ambacho mfumo unaendeshwa juu yake.

# Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones": caption and spoken name of picture 10 (settings-disks.png).
settings-help-topics-files-pic10 = Dirisha la Vifaa vya hifadhi

# Title of the Help topic "Apps that come as an AppImage".
settings-help-topics-appimages-title = Programu zinazokuja kama AppImage

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Apps that come as an AppImage" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-appimages-keywords = appimage app image download portable website install programu pakua tovuti weka

# Help topic "Apps that come as an AppImage": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-appimages-p1 = Baadhi ya programu zinapakuliwa kutoka kwenye tovuti za watengenezaji wake kama faili moja inayoishia .AppImage. Fungua Programu, chagua Zilizowekwa, bonyeza alama ya kujumlisha kando ya Ongeza AppImage, kisha uchague faili. Trindle inainakili kwenye folda ya .appimage kwenye folda yako ya nyumbani, nayo inaonekana kwenye pete na jina lake na picha yake.

# Help topic "Apps that come as an AppImage": paragraph 2.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-appimages-p2 = Imeorodheshwa kwenye ukurasa ule ule pamoja na kila programu nyingine. Ili kuiondoa, bonyeza pipa lake mara mbili. Nakala uliyopakua inabaki ilipo.

# Title of the Help topic "Older programs: Steam, Wine games and Java apps".
settings-help-topics-older-programs-title = Programu za zamani: Steam, michezo ya Wine na programu za Java

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Older programs: Steam, Wine games and Java apps" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-older-programs-keywords = older programs x11 xwayland steam wine games java old apps allow switch watch spy programu za zamani michezo ruhusu swichi tazama pelelezi

# Help topic "Older programs: Steam, Wine games and Java apps": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-older-programs-p1 = Programu nyingi kwenye Trindle huchora madirisha yake kwa njia mpya. Baadhi ya programu za zamani, kama Steam na michezo yake, michezo ya Wine na programu za Java, bado huyachora kwa njia ya zamani, kwa kutumia msaidizi anayeitwa Xwayland. Kwenye eneo-kazi nyingine, programu zote za zamani zinashiriki msaidizi mmoja, kwa hiyo yoyote kati yao inaweza kutazama madirisha ya zingine na unachoandika ndani yake.

# Help topic "Older programs: Steam, Wine games and Java apps": paragraph 2.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-older-programs-p2 = Trindle inapa kila programu ya zamani msaidizi wake mwenyewe, kwa hiyo hakuna inayoweza kuona nyingine. Hii inatumika kwa kila programu uliyoiweka kwenye folda yake yenyewe, na kila programu ya Flathub inayoihitaji. Programu zilizowekwa kwa kompyuta nzima zinashiriki msaidizi mmoja. Msaidizi anaanza tu programu ya zamani inapofunguka na anaacha inapofungwa, kwa hiyo hatumii kumbukumbu wakati mwingine.

# Help topic "Older programs: Steam, Wine games and Java apps": tip 3, shown in a box of its own.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-older-programs-tip3 = Usipotumia programu za zamani kamwe, zima Ruhusu programu za zamani kwenye Mipangilio, Ruhusa. Hazitafunguka ikiwa imezimwa.

