# Title of the Help topic "Language and keyboard".
settings-help-topics-language-title = Lugha na kibodi

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Language and keyboard" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-language-keywords = language keyboard layout british american typing region formats date currency mouse touchpad pointer speed tap click scroll natural left handed lugha kibodi mpangilio kuandika eneo miundo tarehe sarafu kipanya kasi gusa bofya sogeza mkono wa kushoto

# Help topic "Language and keyboard": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-language-p1 = Kwenye Mipangilio, Kibodi na kipanya, unachagua mpangilio wa kibodi, na mpangilio wa pili wa kubadilishia. Kwenye Mipangilio, Eneo na lugha, unachagua lugha ya menyu na jinsi tarehe, pesa na namba zinavyoandikwa. Hilo linaanza kutumika utakapoingia mara ijayo.

# Help topic "Language and keyboard": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-language-p2 = Ukurasa huo huo wa Kibodi na kipanya unaweka kasi ya kielekezi na kusogeza, upande ambao kusogeza kunasogeza ukurasa, na kama vitufe vya kipanya vimebadilishwa kwa matumizi ya mkono wa kushoto. Kwenye kompyuta mpakato pia una mipangilio ya padi ya kugusa: gusa ili kubofya, na kuzima padi wakati unaandika. Kila badiliko linafanya kazi mara moja.

