# Title of the Help topic "Battery, sleep and shutting down".
settings-help-topics-power-title = Betri, kulala na kuzima

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Battery, sleep and shutting down" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-power-keywords = battery power charge sleep suspend shut down turn off restart log out screen betri nishati chaji lala simamisha zima washa upya toka skrini

# Help topic "Battery, sleep and shutting down": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-power-p1 = Mipangilio, Nishati inaonyesha betri na hali ya nishati. Pia inaonyesha ni muda gani unaweza kuwa mbali kabla skrini haijafifia, kufungwa na kuzimwa, na kabla kompyuta haijalala. Kufunga skrini kukishawashwa (angalia hapa chini), Super na L pamoja zinaifunga skrini mara moja.

# Help topic "Battery, sleep and shutting down": paragraph 2.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-power-p2 = Kufunga skrini kumezimwa mwanzoni. Washa Funga skrini chini ya Kufunga kwenye ukurasa huo huo. Kisha chagua kompyuta iachwe peke yake kwa muda gani kabla ya kufunga: ikilala tu, au kuanzia dakika 1 hadi saa 2. Nenosiri lako linaifungua. Ukipenda, unaweza kuongeza pia PIN ya tarakimu nne, ambayo ni ya haraka zaidi. Unachagua PIN inafanya kazi kwa muda gani baada ya kufunga, kuanzia dakika 15 hadi saa 2. Baada ya muda huo, au baada ya majaribio matano yasiyo sahihi, inaomba nenosiri lako. Skrini ikifungwa kwa sababu kompyuta iliachwa peke yake, inaonyesha saa tu, ikielea, hadi urudi. Hakuna kingine kwenye skrini yako kinachoonekana hadi urudi ndani. Kuingia daima kunahitaji nenosiri lako.

# Help topic "Battery, sleep and shutting down": caption and spoken name of picture 3 (settings-power.png).
settings-help-topics-power-pic3 = Ukurasa wa Nishati

# Help topic "Battery, sleep and shutting down": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-power-p4 = Betri inapofikia 10%, onyo linaonekana katikati ya skrini, mara moja, na sauti. Ili kubadilisha kiwango, chagua kingine, au Kamwe, chini ya Onya betri ikifikia. Unapochomeka chaja au kuichomoa, kadi inaonekana kwa sekunde chache, na sauti, ili ugundue kebo ikitoka.

# Help topic "Battery, sleep and shutting down": paragraph 5.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-power-p5 = Ili kutoka, kuwasha upya au kuzima, fungua pete kisha ubofye kitufe cha nishati katikati. Chaguo zinaonekana katikati ya pete. Funga skrini na Kihifadhi skrini vinatokea mara moja. Lala, Hibernate, Toka, Washa upya na Zima vinauliza mara mbili: kubofya kwa kwanza kunajaza kitufe rangi ya kuangazia na kuonyesha tiki, ili kubofya kwa bahati mbaya kusimalize chochote. Msalaba unafunga chaguo.

# Title of the Help topic "Apps that start by themselves".
settings-help-topics-startup-title = Programu zinazoanza zenyewe

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Apps that start by themselves" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-startup-keywords = autostart startup start login automatically launch delay open when i log in anza ingia kiotomatiki kuchelewa fungua ninapoingia

# Help topic "Apps that start by themselves": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-startup-p1 = Mipangilio, Kuanza ukiingia inaorodhesha programu zinazofunguka zenyewe unapoingia.

# Help topic "Apps that start by themselves": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-startup-step2-1 = Ili kuongeza moja, bonyeza kitufe cha gridi na uchague kutoka kwenye programu zilizowekwa kwenye kompyuta hii, au bonyeza kitufe cha terminal ili kuandika amri au kuchagua programu kutoka kwenye diski.

# Help topic "Apps that start by themselves": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-startup-step2-2 = Kila moja ina ucheleweshaji: Mara moja, au baada ya sekunde chache. Tumia ucheleweshaji kwa programu inayohitaji mtandao au programu nyingine iwe tayari kwanza.

# Help topic "Apps that start by themselves": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-startup-step2-3 = Zima programu ili isianze bila kuiondoa kwenye orodha. Pipa linaiondoa.

# Title of the Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts".
settings-help-topics-keys-title = Njia za mkato za kibodi

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-keys-keywords = keys keyboard shortcuts super windows key alt tab screenshot print volume brightness lock terminal close maximise screen reader desktop show vitufe kibodi njia za mkato picha ya skrini sauti mwangaza funga kuza kisomaji cha skrini eneo-kazi onyesha

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-keys-p1 = Unaweza kufanya kila kitu kwa kipanya. Vitufe hivi ni njia za haraka zaidi tu. Super ni kitufe chenye nembo ya Windows kwenye kibodi nyingi.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-1 = Super peke yake, au Super na Space: fungua au funga pete.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-2 = Super na Enter, au Ctrl, Alt na T: fungua Terminal.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-3 = Super na I: fungua Mipangilio.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 4 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-4 = Super na L: funga skrini, kufunga kukishawashwa kwenye Mipangilio, Nishati.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 5 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-5 = Super, Alt na S: washa au zima kusomewa skrini kwa sauti.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 6 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-6 = Super na Q: funga dirisha lililo mbele.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 7 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-7 = Super na Juu: lifanye dirisha lijaze skrini, au lirudishe kwenye ukubwa wake wa awali.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 8 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-8 = Super na Chini: punguza dirisha. Unaweza kulirudisha kutoka kwenye madirisha wazi ya pete.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 9 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-9 = Super na D: ficha kila dirisha ili kuonyesha eneo-kazi, na uyarudishe.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 10 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-10 = Super na N: hamisha udhibiti wa kibodi kwenye arifa zilizo kwenye skrini. Tab inasogea kati ya vitufe vyake, Enter au Space inabonyeza kimoja, na Escape inakurudisha.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 11 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-11 = Alt na Tab: leta kila dirisha lililofunguliwa mbele kwa zamu.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 12 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-12 = Print, au Super, Shift na S: piga picha ya skrini, au ya sehemu yake. Shift na Print: piga picha ya skrini nzima mara moja.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 13 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-13 = Vitufe vya sauti, kunyamazisha na mwangaza vinafanya kazi kama vilivyoandikwa.

# Title of the Help topic "Drives and USB sticks".
settings-help-topics-disks-title = Vifaa vya hifadhi na vifaa vya USB

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Drives and USB sticks" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-disks-keywords = drives disk disks drive usb stick memory card format wipe erase eject power off space full storage partition part resize shrink grow health smart check repair mount start-up startup fstab name folder mnt diski kifaa kadi ya kumbukumbu fomati futa toa zima nafasi jaa hifadhi sehemu ukubwa afya kagua rekebisha unganisha jina folda

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-disks-p1 = Vifaa vya hifadhi ni dirisha lake lenyewe, kwenye Programu zote. Unaweza pia kulifungua kutoka Mipangilio, Kuhusu kompyuta hii. Juu, sentensi moja inasema nafasi kiasi gani imebaki, ikiwa na pete kwa kila sehemu inayotumika. Chini yake inaonyesha kila kifaa kilicho ndani au kilichochomekwa kwenye kompyuta hii, kila sehemu yake imejaa kiasi gani na, kifaa kinapoweza kusema, ina afya kiasi gani na ina joto kiasi gani.

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-disks-step2-1 = Chomeka kifaa cha USB nacho kinaonekana kwenye orodha.

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-disks-step2-2 = Bonyeza folda kuona faili zake, kitufe cha cheza kukiunganisha (kukifanya kipatikane) na kitufe cha simamisha kukitenganisha.

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-disks-step2-3 = Bonyeza toa kabla ya kukichomoa, ili kisipoteze chochote. Kitufe cha nishati kinazima kifaa cha USB kinachoweza kuzimwa, ili kiwe tayari kuchomolewa.

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-disks-p3 = Penseli kando ya sehemu inafungua kinachoweza kubadilishwa kuihusu:

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-disks-step4-1 = Jina: inaitwaje hapa na kwenye kompyuta nyingine.

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-disks-step4-2 = Folda: faili zake zinapoonekana, kama /mnt/backup, badala ya folda iliyopewa jina la namba yake. Iache tupu ili kompyuta ichague.

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-disks-step4-3 = Unganisha wakati wa kuanza: sehemu iko tayari kila kompyuta inapoanza. Kifaa kisipokuwepo, kompyuta inaanza hata hivyo.

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": step 4 of the numbered steps at block 4.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-disks-step4-4 = Ukubwa: ufanye mdogo, au mkubwa ndani ya nafasi tupu iliyo baada yake.

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": step 5 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-disks-step4-5 = Hitilafu: tafuta hitilafu na uzirekebishe. Huwezi kutumia kifaa wakati hili linaendeshwa.

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": step 6 of the numbered steps at block 4.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-disks-step4-6 = Fomati, na Futa sehemu.

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": paragraph 5.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-disks-p5 = Nukta tatu kando ya kifaa zinafuta kifaa chote na kukianza upya kama sehemu moja. Nafasi tupu pia ina penseli, ya kutengeneza sehemu mpya ndani yake. Chagua exFAT kwa kifaa kinachoshirikiwa na Windows na Mac, ext4 kwa kinachotumika na Linux tu, na FAT kwa kifaa kidogo au kifaa cha zamani.

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": tip 6, shown in a box of its own.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-disks-tip6 = Kufomati, kubadilisha ukubwa na kufuta kila kimoja kinahitaji kubofya mara mbili na nenosiri lako. Vinaonyesha jina na ukubwa wa kifaa ili ukague. Trindle haitoi kamwe chaguo lolote kati ya hayo kwa kifaa ambacho kompyuta inaendeshwa kutoka kwacho. Kufuta hakuwezi kutenguliwa, kwa hiyo nakili kwanza chochote unachotaka kuhifadhi.

# Title of the Help topic "Which app opens what".
settings-help-topics-defaults-title = Programu ipi inafungua nini

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Which app opens what" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-defaults-keywords = default apps browser email open with pdf pictures music video links programu chaguo-msingi kivinjari barua pepe fungua kwa picha muziki video viungo

# Help topic "Which app opens what": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-defaults-p1 = Kwenye Mipangilio, Programu chaguo-msingi, unachagua programu ipi inafungua viungo vya wavuti, barua pepe, picha, muziki, video, faili za PDF na folda. Ni programu zilizowekwa na zinazoweza kufungua aina hiyo ya faili tu zinazotolewa.

# Help topic "Which app opens what": tip 2, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-defaults-tip2 = Hakuna kivinjari cha wavuti kinachokuja na Trindle. Pata kimoja kutoka Programu kwanza, kisha unaweza kukichagua hapa.

# Title of the Help topic "Keeping the computer up to date".
settings-help-topics-updates-title = Kuiweka kompyuta kuwa ya kisasa

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Keeping the computer up to date" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-updates-keywords = update updates upgrade security new version debian trindle install firmware bios fwupd sasisha masasisho usalama toleo jipya weka

# Help topic "Keeping the computer up to date": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-updates-p1 = Kila kitu kinasasishwa kutoka sehemu moja: ukurasa wa Masasisho kwenye Programu.

# Help topic "Keeping the computer up to date": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-updates-step2-1 = Fungua Programu kisha uchague Masasisho. Inaorodhesha programu zako, Debian na Trindle yenyewe. Idadi ya masasisho yanayosubiri inaonyeshwa kwenye kitufe cha Programu kwenye pete.

# Help topic "Keeping the computer up to date": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-updates-step2-2 = Bonyeza kitufe cha kusasisha kwenye kila kadi. Unahitaji nenosiri lako ili kusasisha Debian na Trindle, lakini si programu.

# Help topic "Keeping the computer up to date": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-updates-step2-3 = Toka kisha uingie tena baada ya sasisho la Trindle, ili uwe unatumia toleo jipya.

# Help topic "Keeping the computer up to date": paragraph 3.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-updates-p3 = Mara kwa mara watengenezaji wa kompyuta yako, au wa sehemu yake kama kituo cha kuunganisha au padi ya kugusa, hutoa firmware mpya. Firmware ni programu iliyojengwa ndani ya vifaa vyenyewe. Kukiwa na firmware kwa ajili ya kompyuta yako, kadi ya Firmware inaonekana kwenye ukurasa huo huo, ikiwa na toleo jipya kando ya kila sehemu. Kitufe chake cha kusasisha kinaomba nenosiri lako. Kompyuta inaweza kuhitaji kuwashwa upya ili kumaliza, kwa hiyo hifadhi kazi yako na, kwenye kompyuta mpakato, weka chaja ikiwa imechomekwa. Kusipokuwa na kipya, kadi haionekani kabisa.

# Help topic "Keeping the computer up to date": tip 4, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-updates-tip4 = Hakuna kinachojiweka chenyewe. Masasisho yanawekwa tu unapochagua kuyaweka, kwenye pete au kwenye Programu. Mipangilio, programu na faili zako zinabaki kupitia kila sasisho.

# Title of the Help topic "About Trindle".
settings-help-topics-about-title = Kuhusu Trindle

# Words people might search for the Help topic "About Trindle" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-about-keywords = about version what is debian compositor wayland smithay rust licence license gpl warranty risk who made kuhusu toleo ni nini leseni dhamana hatari nani alitengeneza

# Help topic "About Trindle": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-about-p1 = Trindle ni eneo-kazi dogo la Debian 13. Sehemu zake zote zimeandikwa kwa Rust. Sehemu hizo ni kikusanyaji chake cha madirisha, kinachoweka kila dirisha kwenye skrini, na programu moja kwa kila kitu kingine: pete, Mipangilio, Programu, na skrini za kuingia na kufunga.

# Help topic "About Trindle": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-about-p2 = Programu za GTK zinachora pau zake za vichwa zenyewe. Kwa zingine, kama terminal, programu za Qt na zile za zamani za X11, kikusanyaji kinachora upau wa kichwa chenyewe, na vitufe vya duara upande wa kulia kama madirisha ya GTK yenyewe yanavyo. Kuna mstari wa kuficha dirisha, mraba wa kulifanya lijaze skrini, na msalaba wa kulifunga.

# Help topic "About Trindle": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-about-p3 = Trindle ni toleo endelevu, kwa hiyo hakuna ratiba ya matoleo makubwa mara mbili kwa mwaka. Maboresho yanakuja yanapokuwa tayari, kila moja na namba yake. Mipangilio, Kuhusu kompyuta hii inaonyesha namba hiyo, pamoja na kichakataji cha kompyuta, kumbukumbu, michoro na mengineyo. Pia unaweza kubadilisha jina la kompyuta huko. Ukurasa huo pia unahifadhi nyakati kumi za mwisho za kuanza, kuanzia kitufe cha nishati hadi skrini ya kuingia, na unaweza kuhifadhi orodha nzima kwenye Vilivyopakuliwa kwa kubofya mara moja. Kompyuta inachofanya sasa hivi kiko kwenye Shughuli, dirisha lake lenyewe.

# Help topic "About Trindle": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-about-p4 = Programu za zamani zilizoandikwa kwa X11 badala ya Wayland pia zinafanya kazi. Seva ya X ambayo zinaihitaji, Xwayland, inaanza mara ya kwanza kati yao inapofunguka, na haitumii kumbukumbu hadi hapo.

# Help topic "About Trindle": paragraph 5.
settings-help-topics-about-p5 = Ni programu huru chini ya Leseni ya Umma ya GNU, toleo la 3, kwa hiyo unaweza kuitumia, kuibadilisha na kuishiriki. Inakuja bila dhamana ya aina yoyote na unaitumia kwa hatari yako mwenyewe. Weka nakala rudufu ya kila kitu muhimu.

# Help topic "About Trindle": paragraph 6.
settings-help-topics-about-p6 = Tovuti ni trindle.org, na msimbo uko trindle.org/code.

# Help topic "About Trindle": paragraph 7.
settings-help-topics-about-p7 = Mipangilio, Shukrani inaorodhesha miradi ambayo Trindle imejengwa juu yake. Kila mmoja una kiungo cha ukurasa wake wa nyumbani, na moyo unaonyesha wale wanaokubali michango.

# Title of the Help topic "What is running, and why it is busy".
settings-help-topics-activity-title = Kinachoendeshwa, na kwa nini kuna shughuli nyingi

# Words people might search for the Help topic "What is running, and why it is busy" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-activity-keywords = activity task manager system monitor running programs processes processor cpu memory ram busy slow fan hot threads stop close frozen not responding bubbles swap temperature shughuli kidhibiti cha kazi programu zinazoendeshwa kichakataji kumbukumbu polepole feni joto simamisha funga haijibu viputo halijoto

# Help topic "What is running, and why it is busy": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-activity-p1 = Shughuli ni dirisha lake lenyewe linaloonyesha kompyuta inafanya nini sasa hivi. Lifungue kutoka Programu zote, chini ya Mfumo, au kutoka Mipangilio, Kuhusu kompyuta hii.

# Help topic "What is running, and why it is busy": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-activity-p2 = Sentensi juu inasema mambo yalivyo, kama “Hakuna programu inayofanya kazi kwa bidii”, au ni programu ipi inaiweka kompyuta na shughuli nyingi. Chini yake kuna picha ya kompyuta. Duara kubwa ni kumbukumbu, na kila programu ni kiputo ndani yake, kikubwa kama kumbukumbu inayotumia. Programu inayofanya kazi inang'aa na kupiga, kwa kasi na mwangaza zaidi kadri inavyofanya kazi kwa bidii: buluu kwa kazi kidogo, chungwa kwa kazi ngumu na nyekundu kwa kasi kamili. Kuzunguka ukingo kuna upau kwa kila uzi wa kichakataji, unaokua na kupata joto unavyozidi kuwa na shughuli.

# Help topic "What is running, and why it is busy": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-activity-p3 = Trindle inajumlisha sehemu zote za programu, kwa hiyo Firefox ni kiputo kimoja iwe na vichupo vingapi. Viputo viwili vya kijivu tulivu vinaonyesha vingine: Eneo-kazi la Trindle, ambalo ni kila kitu Trindle inachoendesha ili kuwa eneo-kazi, na Linux na programu nyingine. Programu za Trindle, kama Mipangilio na Programu, zinahesabiwa kama programu, si sehemu ya eneo-kazi.

# Help topic "What is running, and why it is busy": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-activity-p4 = Pembeni, pete nne zinaonyesha kumbukumbu, kichakataji, diski na faili ya swap. Kwenye kompyuta isiyo na faili ya swap, ya mwisho inaonyesha halijoto ya kichakataji badala yake. Kwenye pete ya kumbukumbu, sehemu ya Trindle yenyewe iko kwa rangi ya kuangazia, na programu zako na Linux ziko kwa buluu.

# Help topic "What is running, and why it is busy": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 5.
settings-help-topics-activity-step5-1 = Programu ikiacha kujibu, bofya kiputo chake. Kadi inafunguka kando yake na kile inachofanya kwa namba rahisi.

# Help topic "What is running, and why it is busy": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 5.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-activity-step5-2 = Bonyeza kitufe cha kusimamisha kwenye kadi. Kinajaa rangi ya kuangazia na kuonyesha tiki.

# Help topic "What is running, and why it is busy": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 5.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-activity-step5-3 = Kibonyeze tena ndani ya sekunde tatu. Trindle inaiomba programu ifunge, na chochote ambacho hujahifadhi ndani yake kinaweza kupotea.

# Help topic "What is running, and why it is busy": tip 6, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-activity-tip6 = Programu za Trindle yenyewe na za mfumo hazina kitufe cha kusimamisha.

# Title of the Help topic "Trying Trindle in a virtual machine".
settings-help-topics-virtual-machine-title = Kujaribu Trindle kwenye mashine pepe

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Trying Trindle in a virtual machine" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-virtual-machine-keywords = virtual machine vm virtualbox boxes qemu kvm vmware hyper-v parallels utm slow 3d acceleration graphics mashine pepe polepole kasi ya 3d michoro

# Help topic "Trying Trindle in a virtual machine": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-virtual-machine-p1 = Trindle inaendeshwa kwenye mashine pepe, na inakuambia hivyo inapoanza kwenye moja. Utaona hili kwenye dirisha la karibu kwenye kifaa cha USB, na mara moja kwenye arifa baada ya kuweka. Kwenye kompyuta halisi haitaji hilo kamwe.

# Help topic "Trying Trindle in a virtual machine": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-virtual-machine-p2 = Mashine pepe iliyotengenezwa bila michoro ya 3D haina chipu ya michoro ya Trindle kutumia, kwa hiyo kichakataji kinachora kila kitu badala yake. Madirisha, video na kurasa za wavuti zinahisi polepole kuliko zingekuwa kwenye kompyuta halisi, na Trindle inaacha michoro yake ya mwendo ili kusaidia. Kuwasha kasi ya 3D kwenye mipangilio ya onyesho ya mashine pepe kunaleta tofauti kubwa. Kwenye VirtualBox inaitwa Washa Kasi ya 3D. Kwenye GNOME Boxes na virt-manager ni kasi ya 3D au Virtio na OpenGL.

# Help topic "Trying Trindle in a virtual machine": tip 3, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-virtual-machine-tip3 = Hukumu kasi ya Trindle kwenye kompyuta halisi, kwa sababu ndipo ilipokusudiwa kuendeshwa.

# Title of the Help topic "If something goes wrong".
settings-help-topics-trouble-title = Kitu kikienda vibaya

# Words people might search for the Help topic "If something goes wrong" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-trouble-keywords = problem help stuck frozen crash login error broken recover terminal tatizo msaada kwama gandisha anguka kuingia hitilafu imeharibika okoa

# Help topic "If something goes wrong": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-trouble-p1 = Programu ikiacha kujibu, ibofye kulia kwenye pete kisha uchague Funga dirisha. Ikishindikana, au kompyuta ni polepole na hujui kwa nini, fungua Shughuli. Inaonyesha ni programu zipi zina shughuli nyingi, na kitufe chake cha kusimamisha kinafunga programu.

# Help topic "If something goes wrong": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-trouble-p2 = Skrini ya kuingia ikishindwa kuonekana, au kuingia kunakurudisha kwayo, bonyeza Ctrl, Alt na F2 pamoja. Kuingia kwa maandishi kwa kawaida kunaonekana, ambapo unaweza kuingia na kurekebisha mambo. Ctrl, Alt na F7 inakurudisha kwenye skrini ya picha.

# Help topic "If something goes wrong": tip 3, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-trouble-tip3 = Trindle inaweka rekodi ya kila kipindi kwenye .local/state/trindle/session.log kwenye folda yako ya nyumbani. Inaweza kukusaidia kubaini kilichoenda vibaya.

# Title of the Help topic "A chip with no driver".
settings-help-topics-hardware-no-driver-title = Chipu isiyo na dereva wala firmware

# Words people might search for the Help topic "A chip with no driver" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-hardware-no-driver-keywords = driver firmware wifi wi-fi bluetooth sound graphics chip missing no driver mediatek mt7902 not working usb stick dereva chipu haipo haifanyi kazi sauti michoro

# Help topic "A chip with no driver": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-hardware-no-driver-p1 = Chipu inahitaji vitu viwili ili ifanye kazi. Kimoja ni dereva kwenye kernel, ambayo ni kiini cha Linux. Chipu nyingi pia zinahitaji faili ya firmware, ambayo ni programu ndogo ambayo chipu inapakia inapoanza. Unapofungua Mipangilio, Trindle inaangalia chipu za kompyuta yako na kukuambia hapa kama moja haina kimojawapo.

# Help topic "A chip with no driver": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-hardware-no-driver-p2 = Chipu mpya sana inaweza kutokuwa na dereva kwenye kernel ambayo Debian inasambaza. MediaTek MT7902 ni mojawapo. Dereva yake ya Wi-Fi inaonekana kwanza kwenye Linux 7.1, na firmware yake ya Bluetooth iko kwenye firmware-mediatek 20260916. Trindle inasambaza tu kernel thabiti ya Debian, kwa hiyo chipu hii inabaki bila Wi-Fi hadi kernel hiyo ipate dereva.

# Help topic "A chip with no driver": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-hardware-no-driver-p3 = Hadi hapo, kifaa cha Wi-Fi cha USB kinafanya kazi kwenye kompyuta yoyote bila maandalizi. Kichomeke nacho kinaonekana kwenye Mtandao. Ujumbe huu haubadilishi chochote kwenye kompyuta yako.


# Title of the Help topic "Playing games".
settings-help-topics-games-title = Kucheza michezo

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Playing games" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-games-keywords = michezo mchezo kidhibiti games game steam proton windows launcher ubisoft controller gamepad anti-cheat vanguard black screen will not start crash alt-tab hdr

# Help topic "Playing games": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-games-p1 = Steam inafanya kazi. Isakinishe kutoka Programu. Inaendeshwa kama Flatpak, ikiwa tofauti na programu zako nyingine, na inachezesha michezo ya Windows kupitia Proton. Ubisoft Connect imekaguliwa. Vizinduzi vingine kwa kawaida vinafanya kazi ndani ya Steam, lakini kila kimoja kinaweza kuharibika baada ya sasisho lake. Trindle bado haijakagua michezo iliyotengenezwa kwa Linux, michezo ya DirectX 12 wala michezo ya zamani ya biti 32.

# Help topic "Playing games": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-games-p2 = Trindle huongeza kikomo cha kumbukumbu na kikomo cha faili ambavyo michezo mikubwa huhitaji. Mchezo unaoshikilia kipanya unakishikilia hadi ubonyeze Alt na Tab. Mchezo wa skrini nzima hubaki skrini nzima nyuma ya dirisha ulilobadilisha kwenda. Skrini hubaki macho mchezo wa skrini nzima ukiwa mbele.

# Help topic "Playing games": paragraph 3, before the numbered steps.
settings-help-topics-games-p3 = Mchezo usipoanza, jaribu haya kwa mpangilio.

# Help topic "Playing games": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-games-step4-1 = Funga Steam kabisa kisha uifungue tena. Michezo inaweza kushindwa kuanza ikiwa Steam imeendeshwa kwa siku nyingi.

# Help topic "Playing games": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-games-step4-2 = Subiri. Mchezo unapoanza kwa mara ya kwanza, unajenga vivuli vyake, na skrini inaweza kubaki nyeusi kwa dakika chache.

# Help topic "Playing games": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-games-step4-3 = Kagua toleo la Proton kwenye Properties za mchezo, chini ya Compatibility, na ujaribu jingine.

# Help topic "Playing games": step 4 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-games-step4-4 = Ingia kwenye kizinduzi cha mchezo chenyewe, kama Ubisoft Connect. Dirisha lake linaweza kujificha nyuma ya mchezo wa skrini nzima. Bonyeza Alt na Tab ulipate.

# Help topic "Playing games": paragraph 5.
settings-help-topics-games-p5 = Kinga dhidi ya udanganyifu inayoendeshwa ndani ya kernel, kama Vanguard, haiwezi kuendeshwa kwenye Linux kabisa. Easy Anti-Cheat na BattlEye hufanya kazi tu kwa mchezo ambao mchapishaji wake ameruhusu Linux.

# Help topic "Playing games": paragraph 6.
settings-help-topics-games-p6 = Kibodi na kipanya vinafanya kazi. Vidhibiti vya PlayStation, Switch na Xbox vingi, na Steam Input, huenda visifanye kazi kwenye michezo bado. Trindle ina huduma ndogo ya vidhibiti vya michezo, lakini sehemu zinazoitumia hazijakamilika.

# Help topic "Playing games": tip 7.
settings-help-topics-games-tip7 = HDR na kiwango kinachobadilika cha kuonyesha upya bado havitumiki.



# Title of the Help topic "A Bluetooth device will not connect".
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-connect-title = Kifaa cha Bluetooth hakiunganishi

# Words people might search for the Help topic "A Bluetooth device will not connect" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-connect-keywords = bluetooth haiunganishi unganisha sahau oanisha tena vipokea sauti havifanyi kazi kimeoanishwa awali uoanishaji wa zamani connect connecting forget pair again headphones not working paired before old pairing key authentication

# Help topic "A Bluetooth device will not connect": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-connect-p1 = Washa kifaa na kiweke karibu. Kama kiliwahi kuoanishwa na hakiunganishi, au kinaunganisha kisha kinakatika mara moja, uoanishaji uliohifadhiwa kwenye kompyuta hii huenda haulingani tena na ule ulio ndani ya kifaa. Hili linaweza kutokea baada ya kuweka upya kifaa au kukioanisha na kompyuta nyingine.

# Help topic "A Bluetooth device will not connect": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-connect-p2 = Bonyeza Sahau na uoanishe tena kando ya kifaa, au pipa la taka ili kukisahau bila kukioanisha tena. Kisha weka kifaa katika hali ya kuoanisha, kama maelekezo yake yanavyosema, na bonyeza Oanisha kando yake kinapoonekana chini ya vifaa vilivyo karibu.

# Help topic "A Bluetooth device will not connect": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-connect-p3 = Kama bado kinashindwa, sentensi iliyo chini ya kifaa inaeleza sababu. Inaweza kusema Bluetooth imezimwa, kifaa hakijibu, nambari imekataliwa, au sauti ya kifaa haijawa tayari. Kifaa kisipojibu ndani ya nusu dakika, kizime kisha ukiwashe tena, halafu jaribu tena.

# Title of the Help topic "Headphones sound basic".
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-codec-title = Vipokea sauti vinasikika vibaya

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Headphones sound basic" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-codec-keywords = bluetooth ubora wa sauti kodeki vipokea sauti vya kawaida sauti mbaya imezimwa imewashwa bluetooth sound quality codec headphones basic sbc switched off on

# Help topic "Headphones sound basic": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-codec-p1 = Bluetooth inapozimwa na kuwashwa tena, mfumo wa sauti unaweza kukosa njia bora za kutuma sauti kwa vipokea sauti, na kurudi kwenye njia ya kawaida. Muda mfupi baada ya Bluetooth kurudi, Trindle inaanzisha upya sehemu ya Bluetooth ya mfumo wako wa sauti kwa ajili yako.

# Help topic "Headphones sound basic": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-codec-p2 = Kama kuanzisha upya hakukufanya kazi, toka kisha ingia tena na ubora bora unarudi.
